<SiteLayout title="Privacy Policy: Data, Cookies and Advertising | 8PayCommission" description="Privacy policy for 8paycommission.com: browser-only calculators, Google AdSense cookies, server logs, your choices and your rights under Indian law." slug="privacy-policy" h1="Privacy Policy" lead="What we collect, how ads work and your choices." faq={faq} toc={toc} related={related} pageType="info" breadcrumbLabel="Privacy Policy">

<p>Last revised: 3 November 2026. This policy explains what 8paycommission.com collects, how advertising cookies work and your choices.</p>
<h2 id="calculators">Calculators run in your browser</h2>
<p>Salary, arrears, pension, gratuity and allowance calculators run entirely in your browser. The figures you type are not sent to our servers and are discarded when you close the tab.</p>
<h2 id="collect">Information we collect</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>Email you send us.</strong> We receive your address and message and use them only to reply.</li>
<li><strong>Technical logs.</strong> Our hosting provider, Cloudflare, processes standard request data such as IP address, browser type, pages requested and time, to deliver and secure the site.</li>
</ul>
<p>We do not require accounts and do not sell personal data.</p>
<h2 id="ads">Advertising and cookies</h2>
<p>We use Google AdSense to show ads. Google and its partners use cookies or similar technologies to serve ads based on your visits to this and other sites. Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to you based on your visit to our site and other sites on the internet.</p>
<ul>
<li>You can manage personalised advertising in <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" rel="noopener nofollow">Google Ads Settings</a>.</li>
<li>You can also opt out of some third-party vendors at <a href="https://www.aboutads.info" rel="noopener nofollow">aboutads.info</a>.</li>
<li>You can block or delete cookies in your browser settings.</li>
</ul>
<p>See how Google uses data at <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" rel="noopener nofollow">policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites</a>.</p>
<h2 id="links">External links</h2>
<p>We link to government and other sites. We do not control their content or privacy practices.</p>
<h2 id="rights">Your rights</h2>
<p>Under the Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023 and similar laws, you may ask us to access, correct or delete personal data we hold, such as emails you sent. Write to <a href="mailto:dailylifetech.official@gmail.com">dailylifetech.official@gmail.com</a>.</p>
<h2 id="children">Children</h2>
<p>This site is intended for adults and does not knowingly collect information from children.</p>
<h2 id="changes">Changes</h2>
<p>We will update this page and its date if our practices change.</p>

</SiteLayout>
